# Start: node examples/api-client/desktop-smoke-server.cjs
# Open this file in the TidyCode desktop app. Approve local HTTP if prompted.
# The fixture deliberately sends no CORS headers; it should work through native HTTP.
@base_url=http://127.0.0.1:8766

### Native JSON response
GET {{base_url}}/ok

### Read the real 400 error
POST {{base_url}}/error
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials&client_id=synthetic

### Inspect redirect without following
GET {{base_url}}/redirect

### Cancel or set timeout to 1 second
GET {{base_url}}/slow

### Download exact binary bytes
GET {{base_url}}/binary
